YieldcoinShare_mint
├── when the caller does not have MINTER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the recipient is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ERC20InvalidReceiver
└── when the mint is valid
    ├── it should increase the recipient balance and total supply
    └── it should emit Transfer from the zero address
